{
  "work": "Batumi Panoramic Wheel is the waterfront Ferris wheel in the open public Miracle Park, not the decorative Ferris wheel on Batumi Tower. Five official Park/Standalone duplicate searches found no Georgia entity. Adjara and national tourism offices identify the wheel and location; Visit Batumi confirms 55 m, 10-minute rotation and no age restriction. Three exact reusable Commons photos were visually inspected, localized and published. The site and photo binaries returned HTTP 200 before Facebook publication. Current third-party fare figures conflict, and no operator hours or official tariff were located, so no price or schedule was invented.",
